      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37799835205078,
        270.9371337890625,
        470.0482177734375,
        283.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, certainty of evidence moderate [isoniazid and",
